---

<section id="experience" class="py-20 md:py-28 border-b border-border-subtle bg-bg-surface/30">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="space-y-12">
      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-accent">
          <span>02</span>
          <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-accent/40"></span>
          <span class="tracking-widest uppercase">EXPERIENCE &amp; PROMOTION</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary">
          Enterprise Systems &amp; Career Progression
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text-secondary max-w-2xl">
          Continuous operational ownership at Mobily Infotech India Pvt Ltd, transitioning from high-performance internship directly into full-time Software Engineer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline Structure -->
      <div class="relative pl-6 sm:pl-8 border-l-2 border-border-subtle space-y-12 max-w-4xl">
        <!-- Milestone 1: Full-time Software Engineer -->
        <div class="relative group">
          <!-- Timeline Node -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accent border-4 border-bg-base"></div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle hover:border-border-active transition-colors space-y-4 shadow-sm">
            <!-- Header Row -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-border-subtle">
              <div>
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-accent/10 text-accent font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase mb-1">
                  Full-Time Promotion
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary">
                  Software Engineer
                </h3>
                <div class="text-sm text-text-secondary font-medium">
                  Mobily Infotech India Pvt Ltd · Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-tertiary sm:text-right">
                <span class="text-text-primary font-semibold">April 2025 – Present</span>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-accent">Current Role</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bullet Points (Verbatim Content) -->
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-accent mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Promoted to Software Engineer following successful completion of internship, taking on expanded operational and automation responsibilities.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-accent mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Provide frontline technical support and operations management for critical enterprise billing platforms (Oracle BRM), ensuring high availability and strict SLA compliance.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-accent mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Engineered parallelized shell scripts utilizing time-based filtering and background jobs to automate checksum operations for bi-weekly releases, eliminating 100+ manual CLI steps and saving 50+ hours of monthly toil.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-accent mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Participate in 24/7 on-call rotations, diagnosing complex production bottlenecks, executing root cause analysis (RCA), and developing standard operating procedures (SOPs).
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-accent mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Author and optimize complex Oracle SQL queries on large partitioned databases to support capacity management and detect anomalies before end-user service degradation.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Tech Badges -->
            <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Shell Automation</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Oracle BRM</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Oracle SQL &amp; PL/SQL</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Solaris / Linux</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">24/7 On-Call RCA</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Career Promotion Connector Marker -->
        <div class="relative py-1">
          <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-border-active border-4 border-bg-base"></div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-bg-surface border border-accent/30 text-xs font-mono text-accent">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18"/>
            </svg>
            <span>CAREER PROMOTION: INTERN &rarr; SOFTWARE ENGINEER (2025)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Milestone 2: IT Operations Intern -->
        <div class="relative group">
          <!-- Timeline Node -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[31px] sm:-left-[39px] top-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-border-active border-4 border-bg-base"></div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-bg-surface border border-border-subtle hover:border-border-active transition-colors space-y-4 shadow-sm">
            <!-- Header Row -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-border-subtle">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary">
                  IT Operations Intern
                </h3>
                <div class="text-sm text-text-secondary font-medium">
                  Mobily Infotech India Pvt Ltd · Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-tertiary sm:text-right">
                <span class="text-text-primary font-semibold">August 2024 – April 2025</span>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-text-tertiary">9 Months</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bullet Points (Verbatim Content) -->
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-text-tertiary mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Supported day-to-day operations, application telemetry monitoring, and release validation for enterprise billing software.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-text-tertiary mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Diagnosed backend system errors and database exceptions using Unix command-line utilities and analytical SQL queries.
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-text-tertiary mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Assisted release management by executing deployment workflows and reviewing system integration documentation (HLD/LLD).
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="text-text-tertiary mt-1 text-xs">■</span>
                <span>
                  Maintained strict adherence to operational SLAs, gaining hands-on foundation in high-availability enterprise environments.
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Tech Badges -->
            <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 font-mono text-xs">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Unix CLI</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Analytical SQL</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">Release Validation</span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-bg-subtle text-text-secondary border border-border-subtle">HLD/LLD Review</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
